{"id":"5c52bf79e4256ace","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-forcing-ranked-name.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Ranked Name","display":"df-zfc-forcing-ranked-name — ZFC Forcing Ranked Name","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-ranked-name","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-ranked-name"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-ranked-name — ZFC Forcing Ranked Name","depends_on":["[[58-df-p-name]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-ranked-name"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-ranked-name</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-ranked-name — ZFC Forcing Ranked Name"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"51e31cce24feee5c\" href=\"?note=51e31cce24feee5c\" title=\"58-df-p-name\">58-df-p-name</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau,\\mathbb{P},\\alpha \\in V\">\\(\\tau,\\mathbb{P},\\alpha \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N^{\\mathbb P}_\\alpha\">\\(N^{\\mathbb P}_\\alpha\\)</span> is the name-hierarchy stage defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"51e31cce24feee5c\" href=\"?note=51e31cce24feee5c\" title=\"58-df-p-name\">58-df-p-name</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRankedName}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRankedName}_S\\)</span> is the three-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}ranked\\text{-}name} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingRankedName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb P,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\tau\\in N^{\\mathbb P}_{\\alpha+1}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}ranked\\text{-}name} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingRankedName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb P,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\tau\\in N^{\\mathbb P}_{\\alpha+1}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rank is measured in the recursively defined hierarchy of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P\\)</span>-names, not in the ambient cumulative hierarchy <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\alpha\">\\(V_\\alpha\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-p-name","status":"resolved","id":"51e31cce24feee5c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-p-name]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-p-name","status":"resolved","id":"51e31cce24feee5c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)$ and $N^{\\mathbb P}_\\alpha$ is the name-hierarchy stage defined in [[58-df-p-name]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau,\\mathbb{P},\\alpha \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"N^{\\mathbb P}_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRankedName}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}ranked\\text{-}name} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingRankedName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb P,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\tau\\in N^{\\mathbb P}_{\\alpha+1}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":910,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1980","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-forcing-ranked-name.md|58-df-zfc-forcing-ranked-name]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["51e31cce24feee5c"]}